            <span class="status-tag">30 days waiting</span>
            <img class="card-photo" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1668791627301-23690de58952?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&h=500&q=80" alt="Small brown and white pet rabbit, stand-in photo for Cinnamon's simulated profile" loading="lazy">
            <span class="photo-credit">Some Tale / Unsplash</span>
